==Aftermath==
Following the elections, on 25 May Muluzi formed a 25-member [[Cabinet of Malawi|cabinet]], including members of the [[Malawi National Democratic Party]] and the [[United Front for Multiparty Democracy]]. He left three posts unfilled in the hope that the [[Alliance for Democracy (Malawi)|Alliance for Democracy]] would also join the government.<ref name=IPU/>

